    "name": "OmniStock Phase 3 - Multi-Tenant Onboarding & Isolation",
    "description": "Comprehensive automated API smoke and functional test suite for OmniStock MVP Phase 3 (Tenant Onboarding, Authentication, User Management, Audit Logs, RBAC, and Cross-Tenant Isolation).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
